{"resource":{"id":"dl-cheat-sheet","title":"Deep Learning — Cheat Sheet","category":"AI & Data","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"4 min","pages":4,"lastUpdated":"September 2026","tags":["Deep Learning","DL","PyTorch"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518770660439-4636190af475?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"A compact, printable Deep Learning cheat sheet — essential formulas, PyTorch syntax, architecture comparisons, workflow, and debugging tips packed onto four pages."},"toc":[{"id":"s1","label":"1. Neural Network Essentials"},{"id":"s2","label":"2. PyTorch Syntax"},{"id":"s3","label":"3. Activation Functions"},{"id":"s4","label":"4. Loss Functions"},{"id":"s5","label":"5. Optimizers"},{"id":"s6","label":"6. CNN vs Transformer"},{"id":"s7","label":"7. Training Workflow"},{"id":"s8","label":"8. Evaluation Metrics"},{"id":"s9","label":"9. Debugging Tips"},{"id":"s10","label":"10. Quick Commands"},{"id":"review","label":"Cheat Sheet Review"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"glossary","label":"Glossary"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Deep Learning — PDF Notes","tag":"AI & Data","time":"69 min"},{"title":"Deep Learning — Quick Revision Notes","tag":"AI & Data","time":"12 min"},{"title":"Deep Learning — Tips & Tricks","tag":"AI & Data","time":"14 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"s1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. Neural Network Essentials</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>y = Wx + b; params = in·out + out.</li>\n          <li>Init: Kaiming (ReLU), Xavier (tanh).</li>\n          <li>Conv out = ⌊(in + 2p − k)/s⌋ + 1.</li>\n          <li>Attention = softmax(QKᵀ/√dₖ)V.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1526628953301-3e589a6a8b74?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Fig — Neural net + transformer at a glance.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s2\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">2. PyTorch Syntax</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>import torch, torch.nn as nn\nmodel = nn.Sequential(nn.Linear(784,256), nn.ReLU(), nn.Linear(256,10))\noptim  = torch.optim.AdamW(model.parameters(), lr=3e-4)\ncrit   = nn.CrossEntropyLoss()\nloader = torch.utils.data.DataLoader(ds, batch_size=64, shuffle=True)\ndevice = &quot;cuda&quot; if torch.cuda.is_available() else &quot;cpu&quot;\nmodel.to(device)</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">3. Activation Functions</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n          <thead><tr class=\"border-b\"><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">Fn</th><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">API</th><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">Use</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">ReLU</td><td class=\"p-2\">nn.ReLU</td><td class=\"p-2\">Hidden default</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">GELU</td><td class=\"p-2\">nn.GELU</td><td class=\"p-2\">Transformers</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">Sigmoid</td><td class=\"p-2\">nn.Sigmoid</td><td class=\"p-2\">Binary output</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"p-2\">Softmax</td><td class=\"p-2\">nn.Softmax(dim=-1)</td><td class=\"p-2\">Multi-class output</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s4\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">4. Loss Functions</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Classification → nn.CrossEntropyLoss (logits in).</li>\n          <li>Binary → nn.BCEWithLogitsLoss.</li>\n          <li>Regression → nn.MSELoss / nn.L1Loss / nn.SmoothL1Loss.</li>\n          <li>Contrastive → nn.TripletMarginLoss.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">5. Optimizers</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>SGD(momentum=0.9) — baseline.</li>\n          <li>AdamW(lr=3e-4, weight_decay=1e-2) — default.</li>\n          <li>Scheduler: CosineAnnealingLR + LinearWarmup.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s6\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">6. CNN vs Transformer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n          <thead><tr class=\"border-b\"><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">Aspect</th><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">CNN</th><th class=\"p-2 text-left\">Transformer</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">Inductive bias</td><td class=\"p-2\">Locality</td><td class=\"p-2\">Global attention</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">Complexity</td><td class=\"p-2\">O(n)</td><td class=\"p-2\">O(n²)</td></tr>\n            <tr class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">Data need</td><td class=\"p-2\">Medium</td><td class=\"p-2\">High</td></tr>\n            <tr><td class=\"p-2\">Best on</td><td class=\"p-2\">Small vision</td><td class=\"p-2\">Sequence + large data</td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s7\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">7. Training Workflow</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>for x, y in loader:\n    x, y = x.to(device), y.to(device)\n    optim.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)\n    with torch.autocast(device_type=device, dtype=torch.float16):\n        loss = crit(model(x), y)\n    scaler.scale(loss).backward()\n    scaler.unscale_(optim); torch.nn.utils.clip_grad_norm_(model.parameters(), 1.0)\n    scaler.step(optim); scaler.update()</code></pre></div>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Fig — One-glance training pipeline.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s8\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">8. Evaluation Metrics</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Classification: Acc, F1, AUROC, ECE.</li>\n          <li>Detection: mAP@0.5, mAP@[.5:.95].</li>\n          <li>Segmentation: IoU, Dice.</li>\n          <li>NLP: BLEU, ROUGE, BERTScore.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s9\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">9. Debugging Tips</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Overfit a batch of 8 samples.</li>\n          <li>Print param + grad norms per layer.</li>\n          <li>Check DataLoader for label leakage.</li>\n          <li>Assert tensor shapes at layer boundaries.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s10\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">10. Quick Commands</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>code</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>nvidia-smi                          # GPU status\ntorch.cuda.empty_cache()            # release cached memory\ntorch.save(model.state_dict(), &quot;m&quot;) # save weights\nmodel.load_state_dict(torch.load(&quot;m&quot;))\ntorch.compile(model)                # PT 2.x speedup</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"review\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Cheat Sheet Review</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">One-Page Summary</h3>\n        <p>Data → Model → Loss → Backprop → Optimiser → Validate → Save best.</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Top Commands</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><code>optim.zero_grad(set_to_none=True)</code></li>\n          <li><code>loss.backward()</code></li>\n          <li><code>torch.no_grad()</code> for eval</li>\n          <li><code>torch.compile(model)</code></li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Quick Lookup Tables</h3>\n        <p>Activations (§3), Losses (§4), CNN vs Transformer (§6), Metrics (§8).</p>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Fast Revision Checklist</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Correct loss for task?</li>\n          <li>LR schedule + warmup set?</li>\n          <li>Grad clipping enabled?</li>\n          <li>Best checkpoint saved by val metric?</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Can I print this?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Yes — the layout is designed for 4 A4 pages.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Is this enough to learn DL?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">No — pair it with the PDF Notes for depth.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"glossary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Glossary</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>AMP</strong> — Automatic Mixed Precision.</li>\n          <li><strong>LR</strong> — Learning rate.</li>\n          <li><strong>ECE</strong> — Expected calibration error.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n          This resource is intended for educational purposes only. Information is compiled from\n          official documentation, academic publications, research papers, and industry standards.\n          Deep learning frameworks, APIs, and best practices evolve — always consult the latest\n          official documentation for authoritative guidance. All trademarks, logos, and\n          intellectual property belong to their respective owners.\n        </p>\n      </div></section>"}